ived. `SPEC.md` §20.1 indexes the capability.\n\nTwo pre-existing `instance-config` scenarios asserted escaping \"alters exactly three characters\" for *any* rendered value, which the two-regime split makes false for authored fields. Both were scoped to model and identity values rather than left contradicting the requirement above them.\n\n## Verification\n\napi typecheck, lint, 553 unit tests; web typecheck, lint, 318 tests; `openspec validate --all --strict` 17/17. The real stored profile that motivated the change renders with zero entities introduced and exactly one fence closer.\n",
